# Normalise line endings so a fresh Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true on the
# dev machine) behaves the same as the git index, which stores LF.
#
# Shell scripts must keep LF: a stray CR lands inside tokens such as the pin
# comparison in scripts/env-check.sh. Windows batch files want CRLF, which is
# what cmd.exe expects and what the file has historically shipped as.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
